# Dual Cursor Isolation

One folder per window (no multi-root). vcpkg lock: wait in normal builds; do not kill global cmake/vcpkg.
`recover-ide-build.ps1` local by default; `-KillGlobalBuildProcesses` only when alone.
Run `scripts/ensure-dev-isolation.ps1` once per machine for this repo.
